<title>USA: Sanmina names Whitney CFO.</title>
<headline>Sanmina names Whitney CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanmina Corp said Tuesday it named Bernard Whitney chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds President and Chief Executive Officer Randy Furr, who had been serving as interim CFO.</p>
<p>Whitney most recently served as vice president of finance at Network General Corp.</p>
